# expect.stdout: ipt\n
# expect.exit: 0
project PointerReturningRecursion
target console
runtime AgentRuntime 0.1
entry console main
error MainError
errorCase MainError Placeholder CSignedInt32

operation advanceBy
input operation advanceBy buffer CNullTerminatedByteString
input operation advanceBy steps CSignedInt64
output operation advanceBy Result CNullTerminatedByteString Void
memory advanceBy heap no
async advanceBy no
purpose operation advanceBy "Recursively return a pointer offset `steps` bytes past `buffer`. Exercises a recursive user op that returns a pointer (CNullTerminatedByteString)."
invariant operation advanceBy "Each level peels off one step; base case (steps == 0) returns the buffer unchanged."
label startAdvanceBy
storage module immutable zeroSteps CSignedInt64 0
storage module immutable oneStep CSignedInt64 1
call doneCheckCall math.equalI64
argument doneCheckCall left CSignedInt64 steps
argument doneCheckCall right I64 zeroSteps
run doneCheckCall
bind value isDone Bool doneCheckCall
branch if condition isDone target abReturnAsIs
call shiftCall pointer.offset
argument shiftCall base CNullTerminatedByteString buffer
argument shiftCall offset CSignedInt64 oneStep
run shiftCall
bind value shiftedBuffer COpaqueMemoryAddress shiftCall
call decStepsCall math.subtractI64
argument decStepsCall left CSignedInt64 steps
argument decStepsCall right CSignedInt64 oneStep
run decStepsCall
bind value nextSteps CSignedInt64 decStepsCall
call recurseCall advanceBy
argument recurseCall buffer CNullTerminatedByteString shiftedBuffer
argument recurseCall steps CSignedInt64 nextSteps
run recurseCall
bind ok recursiveResult CNullTerminatedByteString recurseCall
return ok recursiveResult
label abReturnAsIs
return ok buffer

operation main
input operation main console Console
output operation main Result ExitCode MainError
effect main read memory.buffer
effect main write console.stdout
memory main heap no
async main no
purpose operation main "advanceBy('semanticscript', 11) should return a pointer to 'ipt' (offset 11 is 'i'). Then writeLine prints 'ipt'."
invariant operation main "Verifies pointer-returning recursive user op + bind of its result + console.writeLine over a bind pointer."
label startMain
storage module immutable phrase CNullTerminatedByteString "semanticscript"
storage module immutable skipCount CSignedInt64 11
call advanceCall advanceBy
argument advanceCall buffer CNullTerminatedByteString phrase
argument advanceCall steps CSignedInt64 skipCount
run advanceCall
bind ok shiftedPointer CNullTerminatedByteString advanceCall
call writeCall console.writeLine
argument writeCall console Console console
argument writeCall text CNullTerminatedByteString shiftedPointer
run writeCall
ignore void source writeCall
storage module immutable successfulExitCode ExitCode 0
return ok successfulExitCode
